WEBVTT

00:13:29.012 --> 00:13:33.350
that undereducate and harm our children.

00:13:34.560 --> 00:13:38.230
And there are a couple of things
that we can do right now.

00:13:38.647 --> 00:13:43.402
We could reallocate
the tens of millions of dollars

00:13:43.402 --> 00:13:47.614
each state spends
on standardized tests every year.

00:13:47.656 --> 00:13:48.657
(Applause)

00:13:48.657 --> 00:13:49.825
Alright.

00:13:49.867 --> 00:13:52.160
(Applause)

00:13:52.160 --> 00:13:58.417
And we can invest the majority of that
in teacher professional development

00:13:58.458 --> 00:14:05.299
so that our teachers can continually hone
their instructional and assessment skills.